          "chunk_id": "s02_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c1_how_expressive_graph_neural_network",
          "text": "How expressive is a graph neural network? For years the field has answered that with the Weisfeiler-Lehman hierarchy, and the gold standard has been to design a model and then prove it matches, say, the third-order test.",
