          "chunk_id": "s02_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c3_what_been_missing_systematic_way",
          "text": "What has been missing is a systematic way to go the other direction: to start from a language we already know is exactly as powerful as 3-W-L, and mechanically build a network that inherits that power.",
