          "chunk_id": "s03_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c1_seed_idea_comes_groundbreaking_obser",
          "text": "The seed of the idea comes from a groundbreaking observation: the 1-W-L and 3-W-L tests can each be rewritten as a fragment of a matrix language called MATLANG.",
