          "chunk_id": "s03_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c2_two_graphs_look_same_3",
          "text": "Two graphs look the same to 3-W-L if and only if every sentence you can write in the fragment ML-of-L-three gives them the same value. That is a beautiful bridge between combinatorics and algebra. But a bridge is not a road.",
