          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s03_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c3_turning_one_these_fragments_actual",
          "text": "Turning one of these fragments into an actual, trainable network had been done only case by case, and the resulting models could not claim the full 3-W-L guarantee.",
