          "required": true
        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s05_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c3_concretely_layer_carries_edge_memory",
          "text": "Concretely, a layer carries an edge memory C and a node memory H; learnable linear blocks combine slices of these tensors, the reduced rules like M-times-M and M-Hadamard-M are computed, and two small MLPs stitch everything back together.",
          "expected_role": "figure",
          "cue_keywords": [
